'''Sol''' is an elevated [[W:Metro station|station]] of the [[Castejón Metro]] serving [[Line 2 (Castejón Metro)|Line 2]], [[Line 3 (Castejón Metro)|Line 3]], [[Line 12 (Castejón Metro)|Line 12]] and [[Line 16 (Castejón Metro)|Line 16]] in the [[Hisbanya]] borough of the [[Castejón Metropolis]].

